   to the weight dtype as a defense so CPU runs also do not crash.
2. Persist runtime counters incrementally (per round, flushed) for BOTH presets: exact memory
   read/write/replay, reliability weight variance (scalar), PRC scalar loss, dropout active-set
   size. Ensure baseline (components off) records explicit zeros/inactive markers.
3. Re-run the SAME PLAN-1 smoke config + seed (`configs/smoke/plan1_cifar100_ehsfp_gate.yaml`),
