3. Distinct output dirs by hash; overwrite guard holds.
4. Runs used CUDA (log device); peak VRAM recorded and within budget.

## Experiment matrix
CIFAR-100 smoke subset; 1 seed (`20260713`); 2 presets; 2 rounds; CUDA. Control = baseline_hsfp.

## Promotion criterion (declared before running)
